WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.620
(machine guns rattling)

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:03.277
- [Narrator] Israel has
entered what it calls,

00:00:03.277 --> 00:00:07.260
"A new phase of its war against Hamas,

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:11.001
with a military advance deep
into the heart of Gaza."

00:00:11.001 --> 00:00:11.834
(tank blasting)

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:14.940
Israel has launched ground
invasions of Gaza before,

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:19.440
most recently in 2009 and 2014.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:20.970
- Israel is at war.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:21.840
- [Narrator] But this time,

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.880
Israeli forces plan to go further

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:27.870
in a multi-phased offensive
into Gaza's sprawling cities

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.250
with the aim of destroying

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.380
the military capabilities of Hamas,

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.449
a US-designated terror group.

00:00:33.449 --> 00:00:35.490
(rocket firing)
(gunshots blasting)

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:38.550
Here's a look at how Israeli
ground forces invaded Gaza

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:41.370
in 2009 and 2014,

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:45.108
and what that reveals about
Israel's current operation.

00:00:45.108 --> 00:00:48.030
(dramatic music)
(tank blasting)

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.170
Israeli ground forces'

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:52.170
most far-reaching military
incursion into Gaza

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:56.940
came during Operation Cast Lead in 2009.

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.880
In response to a barrage of Hamas rockets,

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:02.490
thousands of Israeli troops entered Gaza

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:06.325
from the north and east under
the cover of artillery fire.

00:01:06.325 --> 00:01:08.160
(gunshots blasting)

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:09.360
The three-week offensive

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:12.060
saw extensive street-to-street fighting

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:15.270
as Israeli ground forces
pushed towards Gaza City

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:18.723
with the aim of taking control
of rocket launch sites,

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:22.560
- You have to understand
the way the Gaza was built.

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.660
- [Narrator] Yossi
Kuperwasser is a former head

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:27.480
of Israel's Military
Intelligence Division.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:31.380
- Between the populated area
and the Israeli territory,

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:32.430
there's an open area.

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:35.880
It's very difficult to move
towards the populated area

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.848
because you are totally exposed.

00:01:37.848 --> 00:01:40.230
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:41.520
- [Narrator] As soldiers advanced

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.590
towards Gaza's major cities,

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:46.110
they reported finding dozens of buildings

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:48.150
booby trapped with explosives

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:51.420
intended to inflict
casualties on Israeli troops.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.330
- That's why we prefer to
prepare the battlefield

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:57.090
by a lot of airstrikes to weaken the enemy

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:58.650
so that when we enter,

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:02.460
their abilities are going to be decimated.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:03.720
- [Narrator] During the offensive,

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:07.620
the IDF remained on the
outskirts of Gaza's main cities.

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:10.350
This kept Israel's casualties low,

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.800
and limited its ability to
target Hamas infrastructure

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.570
in built-up areas.

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:17.550
- We didn't mean to take over Gaza.

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:20.700
In 2009, we dealt with the outskirts

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:22.170
of some of the main cities,

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:23.310
but didn't have any intention

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:25.290
to actually enter the center of town.

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:27.990
We didn't put the goal for ourselves,

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:30.840
the uprooting of Hamas from Gaza entirely.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:33.330
We realized that Hamas is
going to stay in place,

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:34.200
and that was a mistake

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.870
because all these rounds
were ended with an agreement

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:39.813
that enabled Hamas to
re-arm itself pretty soon.

00:02:40.763 --> 00:02:42.120
(dramatic music)

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.890
- [Narrator] By the
time the operation ended

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.070
with Israel's implementation
of a unilateral ceasefire,

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:52.020
1,300 Palestinians and 13
Israelis had been killed.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.420
A UN fact-finding mission found evidence

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:57.690
suggesting both Palestinian
armed groups and Israel

00:02:57.690 --> 00:03:00.300
committed actions amounting to war crimes

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.533
during the conflict.

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:07.290
Israel's most recent
ground defensive into Gaza

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.760
was limited in scope

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:11.430
to destroying aspects
of Hamas infrastructure

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:14.580
in the enclave.
(bomb blasting)

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.080
In July 2014,

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:19.170
Israel launched Operation Protective Edge

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:22.710
in response to rockets
and mortar from Hamas.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:24.900
The Israeli Government initially launched

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:28.320
an aerial operation to
destroy a vast network

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:31.260
of underground tunnels
Hamas had constructed

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.520
to store weapons,

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:35.880
including rockets fired
by the group into Israel.

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:37.920
After Hamas, militants used a tunnel

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:41.280
to launch a raid on a
kibbutz in Southern Israel,

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:43.140
(speaking in foreign language)

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:45.210
- [Narrator] the government
authorized ground troops

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:47.340
to cross into Gaza with the aim

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:50.048
of destroying cross-border tunnels.

00:03:50.048 --> 00:03:52.740
(speaking in foreign language)

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:57.720
- Every attempt to enter the
Gaza Strip on the ground,

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.160
it involves, first of all,

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:02.190
anti-tank missiles, mines, booby traps

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:05.550
that are located in places
where you want to enter.

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.470
- [Narrator] Israeli troops
and armor pushed into Gaza

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:13.203
in an effort to locate the
entrances to the border tunnels.

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.230
During the seven-week operation,

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:20.220
the IDF said, "It discovered
it's 62 miles of tunnels."

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:22.080
- The problem with tunnels
is that you don't see them.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.580
It was not easy for us to locate them,

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:27.360
and we had to have a very
strong intelligence effort

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:28.620
to find out where they are,

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.330
and we had to develop a special technique

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:33.447
that would explode them
and make them not function.

00:04:33.447 --> 00:04:34.980
(tunnel blasting)

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:38.340
- [Narrator] Israel says, "Its
troops destroyed 32 tunnels,

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:42.160
14 of which infiltrated
into Israeli territory."

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.500
(tanks rumbling)

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.480
The 2014 conflicts ended

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:49.230
when troops withdrew from Gaza
under a ceasefire agreement

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.870
reached at the end of August that year.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:52.740
- The logic at the time

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:56.820
was that we inflict this heavy
blow on their infrastructure,

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.800
cost them a lot of operatives,

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:02.790
and deal harshly with their
rockets-launching capabilities,

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:03.840
to the point that they will ask

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.700
for a ceasefire under our conditions.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.500
Sometimes it took longer

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:10.170
and sometimes it took a shorter time

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:12.750
before they resumed
their terror operations,

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:17.463
but they were always capable
of recovering relatively fast.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.390
- [Narrator] The fighting
had killed 2,000 Palestinians

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:24.047
and 72 Israelis.

00:05:24.047 --> 00:05:25.290
A United Nations Panel

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.930
found evidence indicating war crimes

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.160
may have been committed

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.980
by both Israel and
Palestinian militant groups

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:33.333
during the conflict.

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:38.070
Israel's previous ground
offensives in Gaza

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:40.260
were much more limited in scope

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:43.500
than what its military
is aiming to do now.

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:45.930
Since Hamas took power in Gaza,

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:48.150
Israel hasn't tried to eliminate

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:49.950
the group's military infrastructure

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.080
and leadership in the enclave

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.070
- For many, many years,

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:54.180
any of the previous rounds,

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:57.840
we tried not to end up
with taking over Gaza,

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.610
but it seems that this time,

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:01.650
we just cannot afford any other solution,

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:03.150
we have to take Gaza

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:04.470
- [Narrator] A ground invasion

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:08.520
with the aim of going into
Gaza's cities to destroy Hamas

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:10.620
presents one of the biggest challenges

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:13.590
the Israeli military has faced in decades.

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:15.810
- This is a dangerous move for any army.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.520
It has to be done slowly and carefully,

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:20.030
and will cost a lot of lives.

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:22.780
(dramatic music)

